I continue walking through the shop.
I am carrying the dark green coat over my arm.
I need something for my ears, because the wind outside is icy.
I want to wear a warm hat.
I see many hats on a table.
I see a yellow hat and a grey hat.
The yellow hat or the grey hat?
I find the yellow hat very beautiful.
I put the yellow hat on.
It is made of wool and very thick.
I look in the mirror.
The dark green coat and the yellow hat look good together.
I look for the price tag.
The hat costs only fifteen Euro.
It is very beautiful, but it is not expensive.
I am keeping the hat.
So I am buying the dark green coat, the grey sweatshirt, and the yellow hat.
